  "description": "<h1 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>1: Brand Introduction-:</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;Welcome to Prime Picks. Based in Dallas, Texas, we're on a mission to empower our affiliates with innovative, high-quality products that resonate with today&rsquo;s modern family. Our products have received exceptional feedback, and we are excited to offer you the opportunity to partner with a brand that is trusted by a growing customer base&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><em>feel free to check out yourself&nbsp;</em><sub>{Please allow a few seconds for reviews to load.&nbsp;</sub><span style=\"vertical-align: sub;\">You can find the reviews by scrolling down the product page}</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: sub;\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>As An Affiliate</strong></span>, you will have the opportunity to represent a brand renowned for its commitment to excellence and exceptional customer satisfaction. This partnership provides you with a compelling and trustworthy offering to present to your audience.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\">Join our affiliate program today and help us share high-quality products while enjoying excellent commission opportunities.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>2. Payment Terms</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\">Commission-: 30% - 60% (depends on product you select)&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Payment Flexibility and Security</span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: left;\">We&rsquo;ve streamlined our payment process to ensure it&rsquo;s both easy and secure by primarily using PayPal for all transactions. PayPal is our Main Method for sending payments, ensuring a smooth and reliable experience. <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>HOWEVER</strong></span>, if you do not have a PayPal account, we will make every effort to provide your payments through alternative methods such as Google Pay or Bank Transfer.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Affiliates receive their commissions within an Average of 3 days from earning them, regardless of the amount. However, please Note that, in rare cases, due to unforseen issues, the maximum processing time may extend to 7 days. This ensures that even if there are occasional delays, your commissions are still processed efficiently.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\">We take pride in our transparent and reliable payment practices, ensuring that your earnings are handled with the utmost integrity.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Join us today and experience a hassle-free affiliate program with the freedom to manage your earnings on your terms.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>5. Other Information</strong></span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><em>Marketing Materials</em>:</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;Affiliates will have access to a variety of marketing materials, including product images, video's and other promotional content.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><sup>[[If more content Required-: Contact us via the support email.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&gt;if possible&lt; We can deliver within 60 minutes]].</sup></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><sup></sup></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Support</strong>:</span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">A dedicated affiliate success manager will be available to provide support and answer any queries.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"mailto:AffiliateSupport@Prime-Picks.Shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">AffiliateSupport&gt;&gt;</span></a>&gt;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><sub>[Average response time: 30 minutes]</sub></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<h3><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Sign-Up Bonus:</span></strong></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;New affiliates receive a sign-up bonus after their first successful referral. After the initial referral bonus, affiliates receive an Additional-Bonus for every 10 successful referrals.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><em>with the cycle continuing indefinitely</em>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p><strong></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Resources for Information:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/10T8jr_B2NJRYfBqkYD54hpLbI17trJhYtu6q0--4VpM/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Explore More &gt;&gt;</a></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><sub>~For any Querys; Connect with us at-:</sub></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">AffiliateSupport@Prime-Picks.Shop</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>",
